@startuml seq-send-branch
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam shadowing false
title A sending flow — send-branch\n(spec: flows.spec.ts · group "structural flows")
' Aliases match docs/specs/component-map.puml:
'   PAGE_CHAT · ORCH_RUNNER · ORCH_CONTEXT · ORCH_TRANSPORT · SVC_CHAT
'   SVC_LORE · PORT · LEAF_REVEAL

actor User
participant "PAGE_CHAT\nChatComponent" as PAGE
participant "ORCH_RUNNER\nLlmFlowRunner" as RUN
participant "flows/sends\nsendBranch()" as SEND
participant "SVC_CHAT\nChatService" as SVC
participant "SVC_LORE\nensureLoreNodeBefore()" as LORE
participant "ORCH_CONTEXT\ncontext factory" as CTX
participant "ORCH_TRANSPORT\nLlmOrchestratorService" as TR
participant "LEAF_REVEAL\nStreamReveal" as REV
participant "PORT\nChatApiPort" as API
participant "provider\nSSE stream" as NET

== 1. Resolve the write model, then branch ==
User -> PAGE : types a direction, hits send
PAGE -> RUN : run({chat, node, usecase:'send-branch',\n vars:{content}})
RUN -> RUN : resolveWriteModel(node, vars.modelId, vars.providerId)
note right of RUN
  flows.spec "isFlowUsecase recognizes the structural kinds"
  send-branch must stay a FLOW usecase (append / render-node must not).
end note
alt no enabled writing model
  RUN --> PAGE : { error: 'No writing model is enabled.' }
else model resolved
  RUN -> SEND : sendBranch(env)
end

== 2. Create the question node ==
SEND -> SVC : branchQuestion() | addNode()\n(user node → sibling, answer node → child)
note right of SEND
  flows.spec asserts the new question is a REAL sibling:
  id ≠ q1, parentId null (root), content = vars.content.
end note
SVC -> API : branchUser / createNode
API --> SVC : persisted node
SEND -> SVC : setActiveChild(parent, newQuestion.id)
note right of SEND
  switching the active path BEFORE the stream is what makes the
  answer paint live (send-insert documents the same reason).
end note

== 3. Lore node in front of the direction ==
SEND -> LORE : ensureLoreNodeBefore(chatId, questionId)
LORE -> SVC : materialize / re-arm ONE lore node as parent
note right of LORE
  see seq-lore-once for the full lifecycle
  (excludeAfterSend → sent once → deactivated).
end note

== 4. Build the request ==
SEND -> CTX : prepareTextSend(env, chatId, question, {content, attachments})
CTX -> CTX : chat history + lore + chapter-plan slice\n+ attachments / interpretation
CTX --> SEND : messages[]
SEND -> SVC : persistInterpretation() (only when images were described)
note right of SEND
  flows.spec: interpretation runs ONLY when the description is
  not yet stored in the node text.
end note

== 5. Placeholder + stream ==
SEND -> SVC : addNode(role:assistant, content:'')
SVC -> API : createNode
SEND -> SVC : setActiveChild(question, answer)\nstartGeneration(answer.id)
SEND -> TR : completion({messages, stream, imageCapable}, {onChunk})
TR -> NET : POST /proxy (SSE)
loop each chunk
  NET --> TR : delta.content / delta.thinking / images[]
  TR --> SEND : onChunk(chunk)
  SEND -> SEND : accContent += chunk
  SEND -> REV : update(accContent, accThinking)
  REV -> SVC : updateNodes() — paint only the revealed prefix
end

== 6. Finish the reveal, then finalize ==
TR --> SEND : slots {text, thinking, images, usage}
SEND -> REV : finish(accContent, accThinking)
note right of REV
  the whole buffer is shown before the node is versioned,
  so the bubble grows instead of jumping.
end note
SEND -> SEND : imageOnlyAnswerContent()\n(a picture without text ⇒ chapter = direction text)
alt content / thinking / images present
  SEND -> SVC : editAssistant(answer.id, content, attachments, thinking, usage)
  SVC -> API : editAssistant → NEW version row, old row retired
  API --> SVC : versioned node (new id)
  SEND -> SVC : setActiveChild(question, versioned.id)
  note right of SEND
    flows.spec: answerNodeId is the VERSIONED id, the answer's
    parentId is the new question, slots.flow.activateId is set,
    slots.text.value is the full text.
    An IMAGE-ONLY answer is finalized too (never left empty).
  end note
  SEND -> SVC : reparentNodes(adoptNodeIds) — only send-insert
else nothing arrived
  SEND -> SEND : flowEmpty(slots) = true (bubble stays a placeholder)
end
SEND --> RUN : slots + flow{questionNodeId, answerNodeId, activateId}
RUN --> PAGE : slots
PAGE -> PAGE : render via ChatService signals (nodes(), activeChildMap)

@enduml
